aths": ["src/naive/date.rs"]}], "tests": ["naive::date::tests::test_date_from_num_days_from_ce"]}, "shard": "chrono", "status": "blocked", "subject": "Fix panic in from_num_days_from_ce_opt", "summary": "NaiveDate::from_num_days_from_ce_opt adds 365 to its i32 input, overflowing for values near i32::MAX and panicking with overflow checks enabled. The fix uses checked_add(365)? to return None on overflow. The fix extends the existing test with boundary assertions, including i32::MAX, which should detect the reversed implementation in a debug test run. No tests were executed during planning.", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T23:03:58.736573+00:00"}
